<cit><quote><lg type="poem" rendition="#aq"><l>Ante mare &amp; tellus (&amp; quod tegir omnia)<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">c&#x0153;lum.</hi></l><lb/>
<l>Unus erat toto naturæ vultus in orbe.<lb/>
