<cit><quote><lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq">Prima dies lucem profert, locat altera<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">c&#x0153;lum</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Po&#x017F;t hæc &#x017F;tat tellus, quarto duo lumina lu-<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">cent,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Quinta replet va&#x017F;tum variis animalibus<lb/>
